# The VH win-rate climb's nominee (log 2026-09-10): evolve6 g0m3, best
# of 96 genomes over six generations of 8 pairs vs the champion
# (rng 17, spec vh, margin fitness), +2.299 margin delta at n=8 -- a
# generation-tier read the panel judges, not a result. The run's whole
# converged direction compiled into one army slot: a c_tank became a
# second hoverTank (champion c_tank x3 + heavyTank + hoverTank; this
# c_tank x2 + hoverTank x2 + heavyTank), every knob and tactic the
# champion's own. The hover-for-heavy lean evolve1/evolve2 measured as
# a flat direction is here EXPRESSED in the artifact for the first
# time. Generation fitness is selection-biased and adopts nothing;
# this faces the 48-pair win bar on untouched seeds (laws six, nine).
